# Line endings
#
# The bundled web app must stay byte-identical to what moddys.net serves, so git must
# not rewrite line endings inside it: a newline inside a JS template literal is content,
# and byte-identity is what makes hash comparisons against the live site meaningful.
app/src/main/assets/www/* -text

# Source files: normalise to LF in the repository (checked out per platform default).
*.java text
*.gradle text
*.xml text
*.yml text
*.md text
